Depends: nodejs-24, nodejs-sqlite3
Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/l3tnun/EPGStation
Tag: purpose::console
Description: DTV recording manager (Mirakurun/mirakc client)
 EPGStation 2.10.0 for rootless jailbreaks. JS payload is built on Mac.
 Native sqlite3 comes from nodejs-sqlite3. ffmpeg is not required to
 start; unconverted live and raw TS recording work without it.
 Default mirakurunPath is http://127.0.0.1:40772/. Config lives in
 /var/jb/var/lib/epgstation/config.yml.
